# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large official raster (418,912,844 B). Not committed: it exceeds any sensible
# git budget and is reproducible. scripts/prepare_data.py places it and
# re-verifies its sha256 against the pin in data/README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/official/training_features.tif

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived artifacts. evidence/*.npz are rebuilt by the scripts that wrote them
# (scripts/explore_zone.py, explore_zone2.py, build_submission.py); the 27 MB
# final_surface.npz especially is a build product, not an audit trail. The
# evidence JSONs and the shipped submission file ARE committed: they are the
# audit trail the site renders, and they are small.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
evidence/*.npz

